def find_Diff(arr, n):
    frequency = {}
    for num in arr:
        if num in frequency:
            frequency[num] += 1
        else:
            frequency[num] = 1

    max_freq = max(frequency.values())
    min_freq = min(frequency.values())

    return max_freq - min_freq
```

